Description: Zovelis OS installer configuration
 Configuration, branding and helper scripts that turn the Calamares
 installer into the Zovelis OS installer:
  * a short guided installation (language, time zone, keyboard, disk,
    user account) with optional full-disk encryption,
  * GRUB with Secure Boot support on UEFI and on BIOS computers, installed
    from the installation medium without needing the internet,
  * removal of the live-system tools from the installed system,
  * the "Install Zovelis OS" launcher on the live desktop.
 .
 This package is only useful on the Zovelis OS live system; the installer
 removes it from the system it installs.
